WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From all fours, keep the hips stacked over the knees and walk the hands forward.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Lower the chest toward the floor, arms extended, palms pressing down.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Rest the forehead (or chin) on the mat and let the heart melt downward.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the hips high and the arms active - this is a stretch, not a collapse.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
To exit, walk the hands back and sit onto the heels.
